015b & Frozen emb & frz$^b$ & ON & 8 & 204.2 @105K & 0.47$\times$ & Grad.\ starvation \\
\midrule
018 & Full-SGS & trn$^\ddagger$ & ON & 8 & \sgseval{} @105K & \sgsnve{}$\times$$^*$ & No collapse \\
